   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ministry of Foreign Affairs of the Netherlands</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evaluation Subsidy Framework for Migration and Displacement - executed by ADE.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Migration and Displacement Grant Policy Framework (SBK) requires an independent external evaluation due in part to its innovative nature and the total budget of EUR 57 million.

This evaluation, focusing among others on relevance, coherence, effectiveness, and sustainability, will contribute to understanding the effectiveness of the SBK as an innovative grant instrument.

It supports sustainable and inclusive development in our focus countries, as envisioned in the Dutch localization agenda.
The outcomes will also serve to ensure accountability for ODA funds, enhance transparency, and provide input for future policy and program planning.

This assignment focusses on the baseline, monitoring and endline of the Subsidy Framework for Migration and Displacement.</narrative>
  </description>
